<title>INDIA: India clears counter-guarantee for Mangalore plant.</title>
<headline>India clears counter-guarantee for Mangalore plant.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian cabinet on Thursday approved a counter-guarantee agreement for U.S.-based Cogentrix Inc's Mangalore power plant in the southern state of Karnataka, the government said in a statement.</p>
</text>
